  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So for the past week now, whenever there are about 10 or more avatars in the same world, SteamVR will tell me it's waiting for VRChat, and then it will follow with me standing in the room with the rotating VRChat symbol as it says loading, and then I am booted to the HUB world.\n\nGoing back to the world yields the same results within a minute. This hasn't happened before, and it's affecting my experience with the Sunday meet-ups. Is there a fix to this problem? As I know some of my friends on there are not experiencing this with the same world as me.",
